{
  "id": "bamboohr",
  "name": "BambooHR",
  "status": "Starting template. Download the import template from your own account and compare the column headers and order before the first live upload; copy this file to <workspace>/connectors/ and edit it there.",
  "docs": [
    "Roster: Reports > New custom report with Employee #, First Name, Last Name, Status, Hire Date, Termination Date, Location, Job Title, Pay Rate, Pay Type; export to CSV or Excel.",
    "Time off: the 'Time Off Used' report for exactly the pay period dates.",
    "Hours: Settings > Account > Import Hours (template has Employee #, Hours Worked Date, Rate Type, Hours Worked ...). Rate Type is REG, OT or DT.",
    "Dollar amounts: Payroll tab > Extra Pay > Upload Extra Pay (Employee Number, Pay Type, Amount). Pay Type must match a BambooHR pay type name exactly.",
    "If BambooHR Payroll already pays approved time off from its own records, set those pay codes to export_as 'none' so they are not paid twice.",
    "Leave Pay Rate blank in the hours file unless you mean to override the compensation table."
  ],
  "inbound": {
    "roster": {
      "columns": {
        "employee_id": [
          "Employee #",
          "Employee Number",
          "Employee ID",
          "EEID"
        ],
        "payroll_id": [
          "Payroll ID",
          "File Number",
          "File #"
        ],
        "first_name": [
          "First Name",
          "Legal First Name",
          "First name"
        ],
        "last_name": [
          "Last Name",
